</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">答案；解答</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"233412\">あなたの<ruby>解答<rp>(</rp><rt>かいとう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちとしてはまったく<ruby>不満<rp>(</rp><rt>ふまん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我对你的答案完全不满。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">街道</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいどう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">大道；主干道（尤指江户时代存在的）；（比喻）通往（成功等）的道路；途径；（中国的）街道（街道办事处辖区）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"184639\"><ruby>街道<rp>(</rp><rt>かいどう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>沿<rp>(</rp><rt>ぞ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いのドライブインで<ruby>昼食<rp>(</rp><rt>ちゅうしょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をとった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我们在街道上开车吃午餐。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">介入</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいにゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">干预；介入</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"176285\"><ruby>警察<rp>(</rp><rt>けいさつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>騒動<rp>(</rp><rt>そうどう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>介入<rp>(</rp><rt>かいにゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">警方干预了冲突。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">開発</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいはつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">开发；开拓；应用；（资源的）开采；开发</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"180338\"><ruby>教育<rp>(</rp><rt>きょういく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>潜在<rp>(</rp><rt>せんざい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する<ruby>能力<rp>(</rp><rt>のうりょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>開発<rp>(</rp><rt>かいはつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をめざすものだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">教育是为了发展潜在能力。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">海抜</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいばつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">海拔；海拔高度</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"210447\">その<ruby>山<rp>(</rp><rt>やま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>海抜<rp>(</rp><rt>かいばつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>約<rp>(</rp><rt>やく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>３０００メートルだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这座山的海拔约为3000米。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">回復</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいふく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">恢复；复原；康复；回复；改善；（病后）恢复；痊愈；康复</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"185180\"><ruby>回復<rp>(</rp><rt>かいふく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はほとんど<ruby>不可能<rp>(</rp><rt>ふかのう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">恢复几乎是不可能的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">介抱</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいほう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">护理；照顾</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">解放</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいほう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">释放；解放；解除束缚；使自由；（计算机内存的）释放；解除分配</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"144195\"><ruby>人質<rp>(</rp><rt>ひとじち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>解放<rp>(</rp><rt>かいほう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>されるだろう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">人质将被释放。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">開放</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいほう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">打开；敞开；开放；向公众开放；允许公众使用</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"220457\">この<ruby>庭園<rp>(</rp><rt>ていえん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>一般<rp>(</rp><rt>いっぱん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>開放<rp>(</rp><rt>かいほう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>されています。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个花园一般开放。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">解剖</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいぼう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">解剖；尸检；验尸；分析；事后检讨</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">買い物</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいもの</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">购物；购买的商品</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"216415\">ジェーンは<ruby>買<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>物<rp>(</rp><rt>もの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>で</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かけている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">珍外出购物。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/825932\" title=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">海洋</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいよう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">海洋；海</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"143446\"><ruby>世界<rp>(</rp><rt>せかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>四<rp>(</rp><rt>よっ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つの<ruby>海洋<rp>(</rp><rt>かいよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">世界上有四个海洋。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">回覧</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">かいらん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（文件等的）传阅；流转</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"112688\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>手紙<rp>(</rp><rt>てがみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>全員<rp>(</rp><rt>ぜんいん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>回覧<rp>(</rp><rt>かいらん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他把这封信看给了所有人。</span></div></li>"]